-profile-what-is","line":158},{"title":"Due diligence workflow","target":"tprm-workflow-in-workspace","line":159},{"title":"factors","target":"factors","line":160},{"title":"Smart Assessment Engine","target":"smart-asmnt-engine-landing-page","line":161},{"title":"Assessment templates","target":"airc-assessment-templates","line":162},{"title":"Smart Assessment response assist skill","target":"ai-generated-responses-for-smart-assessment","line":163},{"title":"Now Assist for Third-party Risk Management \\(TPRM\\)","target":"now-assist-tprm","line":164},{"title":"Reopen an assessment","target":"trpm-reopen-assessment","line":165}],"metadata":{"title":"Assessing your third-party risk","description":"Use Third-party Risk Management to identify and assess potential risks that are associated with your third-party relationships. The information gathered from internal questionnaires, external questionnaires, and documentation requests helps you to understand the third party's risk profile, determine the appropriate risk mitigation strategies, and determine whether the third party or engagement meets all necessary compliance requirements.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/governance-risk-compliance/third-party-risk-management/tprm-assessing-tpr.html","release":"australia","product":"Third-party Risk Management","classification":"third-party-risk-management","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":15,"breadcrumb":["Third-party Risk Management","Governance","Risk","and Compliance"],"tags":["#governance-risk-compliance","#vendor-risk","#tprm","#grc","#third-party","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/governance-risk-compliance/third-party-risk-management/tprm-assessing-tpr.md"},
